  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "The students at Riverside Middle School couldn't ignore it anymore.",
      "startSeconds": 0,
      "durationSeconds": 4.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Every spring, the creek behind their school flooded with murky, polluted water.",
      "startSeconds": 4.8,
      "durationSeconds": 5.35
    },
    {
      "text": "\"We have to do something,\" said Amara, staring at the brown water pooling near the playground.",
      "startSeconds": 10.45,
      "durationSeconds": 5.825
    },
    {
      "text": "She felt a deep ache thinking about the frogs and fish that used to live there.",
      "startSeconds": 16.575,
      "durationSeconds": 4.85
    },
    {
      "text": "Their science teacher, Mr. Chen, showed them data from a nearby city where students had successfully restored a wetland area.",
      "startSeconds": 22.125,
      "durationSeconds": 8.425
    },
    {
      "text": "\"If they could do it, we can too,\" he said.",
      "startSeconds": 30.85,
      "durationSeconds": 3.1
    },
    {
      "text": "The class erupted with ideas.",
      "startSeconds": 34.25,
      "durationSeconds": 2.425
    },
    {
      "text": "They had seen change happen before — the community garden downtown was once an empty lot.",
      "startSeconds": 36.975,
      "durationSeconds": 6.175
    },
    {
      "text": "The class formed three teams.",
      "startSeconds": 43.85,
      "durationSeconds": 2.275
    },
    {
      "text": "Team one would test water quality weekly and log the results.",
      "startSeconds": 46.425,
      "durationSeconds": 4.275
    },
    {
      "text": "Team two would research native plants that filter pollutants.",
      "startSeconds": 51,
      "durationSeconds": 4.175
    },
    {
      "text": "Team three would write a proposal to the city council asking for funding to install a rain garden.",
      "startSeconds": 55.475,
      "durationSeconds": 6.825
    },
    {
      "text": "They created a timeline and assigned roles.",
      "startSeconds": 62.6,
      "durationSeconds": 3.125
    },
    {
      "text": "Amara led the presentation to the city council.",
      "startSeconds": 66.425,
      "durationSeconds": 3.675
    },
    {
      "text": "She brought water samples, charts, and photos.",
      "startSeconds": 70.4,
      "durationSeconds": 3.25
    },
    {
      "text": "The council approved their proposal.",
      "startSeconds": 73.95,
      "durationSeconds": 2.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Over the next two months, the students planted 200 native plants along the creek bank.",
      "startSeconds": 76.85,
      "durationSeconds": 5.775
    },
    {
      "text": "They organized weekend volunteer days.",
      "startSeconds": 82.925,
      "durationSeconds": 3.075
    },
    {
      "text": "By the end of the school year, the water quality tests showed a 40% improvement.",
      "startSeconds": 86.3,
      "durationSeconds": 5.625
    }
  ],
